1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,281
All right next stop saying yes to everything wow.
好，接下来，别再对所有事情都答应，哇。

2
00:00:08,281 --> 00:00:11,961
I think that's still uh no actually would you agree kiara.
我觉得这件事我还在——不，等等，你会同意吗，Kiara？

3
00:00:11,961 --> 00:00:20,961
I've been very very good at moderating this no that when I was in my 20 s I say yes to everything.
我在控制这方面已经做得很好了；二十几岁时，我真是什么都答应。

4
00:00:20,961 --> 00:00:30,351
And I think to a certain extent there's a lot of wisdom in that say yes to all the experiences and opportunities that you can with boundary.
某种程度上，这也有道理：可以接受各种体验和机会，但得有边界。

5
00:00:30,361 --> 00:00:36,361
So even if it doesn't make you a lot of money even if it's not like the greatest adventure of your life.
即使不怎么赚钱，或者并非人生中最精彩的冒险，

6
00:00:36,361 --> 00:00:42,481
Even if it's not the most logical decision obviously we don't want immoral decisions right bad decisions.
即使不是最符合逻辑的选择——当然，我们不想作出不道德或糟糕的决定。

7
00:00:42,481 --> 00:00:51,801
But spontaneous trips spontaneous vacation spontaneous um out of town trips because you wanted to volunteer.
比如临时起意的旅行、度假，或者为了做志愿者而出城。

8
00:00:51,801 --> 00:00:59,921
All of these other things I think there's merit in doing all those things but you have to set the boundary what is the boundary.
我认为这些事都有价值，但必须设定边界。边界在哪里？

9
00:00:59,921 --> 00:01:06,601
One is it getting in the way of your priorities already so yes yes yes okay lang.
第一，它已经妨碍你最重要的事情了吗？这里的 lang 是代码切换，不作为英语教授。

10
00:01:06,601 --> 00:01:15,361
If it's getting in the way of you getting proper rest of you you know fostering your relationship with god and with your family and with the people that you love.
如果它妨碍充分休息，妨碍维系与上帝、家人及所爱之人的关系，

11
00:01:15,361 --> 00:01:21,401
If it's getting in the way of you performing excellent at work then probably you have to reconsider these things right.
如果妨碍你把工作做好，那也许就得重新考虑这些决定。

12
00:01:21,401 --> 00:01:26,801
I'm all for being a yes person because being a yes person means that you.
我支持愿意接受机会的人，因为这样的人意味着你——这里她停下来重新组织表达。

13
00:01:26,801 --> 00:01:37,440
But for me being a yes person means that you are thoughtfully considering things and the disposition is always yes but yes but.
对我而言，是认真考虑，心态倾向于“好，不过……好，不过……”。

14
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:41,681
Yes but is this going to draw me closer to god.
好，但这会让我更接近上帝吗？这是她的个人信仰标准。

15
00:01:41,681 --> 00:01:50,801
Yes but is this going to make me the kind of person is this going to bring me closer to becoming the kind of person that I want to be in the next 5 or 10 years.
好，但这会让我成为想成为的人，让我更接近五年或十年后理想的自己吗？

16
00:01:50,801 --> 00:01:57,681
Yes but is this the the place where I want to grow and learn from right now.
好，但这里是否是我现在想成长、想学习的地方？

17
00:01:57,681 --> 00:02:06,791
So saying yes to everything obviously not a good thing but saying yes mindfully and intentionally is where you want to go.
所以，什么都答应当然不好，但经过觉察和认真选择后答应，是她希望的方向。

18
00:02:06,801 --> 00:02:17,361
Say yes but also set boundaries so that you're not exhausted you're not fully just you know putting yourself out there and exhausting yourself with rash decisions okay.
说好，也设边界，免得筋疲力尽，或者因草率决定而过度消耗自己。

19
00:02:17,361 --> 00:02:24,320
Next stop fearing failure.
接下来，别再惧怕失败。

20
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:30,000
I was listening to this podcast recently k andrew huberman and adam grant.
我最近在听一个播客，她提到 Andrew Huberman 和 Adam Grant；夹入音节保留待核对。

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:39,241
And adam grant was saying that every year he makes it a point that he does a project a new project.
她转述说，Adam Grant 每年都会特意做一个新项目，

22
00:02:39,241 --> 00:02:45,641
That would allow him to make mistakes or would allow him a bit of space for failure.
让自己有犯错的可能，也给失败留一点空间。

23
00:02:45,641 --> 00:02:52,320
So he doesn't obviously do the project to fail rather he does it with the risk of failure.
当然，他不是为了失败才做项目，而是接受其中失败的风险，

24
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:56,880
And understanding that that kind of risk is something that he welcomes in his life.
也明白这种风险是他愿意在生活中接纳的。

25
00:02:56,880 --> 00:03:05,721
And the point that he was trying to make was if you don't allow yourself that space for the risk of failure.
她说，重点是：如果不给自己承担失败风险的空间，

26
00:03:05,721 --> 00:03:08,521
Then you won't have any room to grow.
就不会有成长的空间。

27
00:03:08,521 --> 00:03:18,241
And I think right now in a society culture and time where the only thing that's really positively recognized are your successes.
如今这种社会与文化中，受到正面认可的似乎只有成功，

28
00:03:18,241 --> 00:03:24,320
The highlights of your life the good things that are happening to you and then anytime you make a mistake it's so magnified.
是人生高光、正在发生的好事，而你一旦犯错，就仿佛被放得很大。

29
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:27,791
Anytime that you make a slip up it's so magnified.
任何一次失误，似乎都会被放大。
